WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.969 --> 00:00:03.993
- Wheee! (laughs)

00:00:13.106 --> 00:00:14.395
- Nimco Mix.

00:00:14.395 --> 00:00:17.724
- Suitable for vegetarians,
not recommended but suitable.

00:00:17.724 --> 00:00:19.116
- This looks really fun.

00:00:19.116 --> 00:00:20.474
- There's a lot going on here.

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:23.796
- Oh!

00:00:23.796 --> 00:00:26.728
- So many flavors I don't recognize.

00:00:26.728 --> 00:00:27.956
- Cinnamon and cardamom.

00:00:27.956 --> 00:00:28.908
- I don't know what those are.

00:00:28.908 --> 00:00:30.339
- It's like Chex Mix made of cologne.

00:00:30.339 --> 00:00:31.752
- A little spicy.

00:00:31.752 --> 00:00:33.236
- Oh, and it settles really well.

00:00:33.236 --> 00:00:35.692
- This is like what bar food
would taste in a fever dream.

00:00:35.692 --> 00:00:36.646
- It's pretty good.

00:00:36.646 --> 00:00:39.211
- It's like I opened
every ramen flavor pack,

00:00:39.211 --> 00:00:40.515
and poured it into my mouth.

00:00:40.515 --> 00:00:42.681
- Guys like me who love spicy food,

00:00:42.681 --> 00:00:43.804
this would make a perfect snack.

00:00:45.572 --> 00:00:47.835
- [voiceover] It's Dal Moong.

00:00:47.835 --> 00:00:49.891
- Delicious and crispy, let's see.

00:00:49.891 --> 00:00:51.579
- This is the most fun.

00:00:51.579 --> 00:00:54.536
- It looks like we've got
fossilized Rice Krispie treats.

00:00:56.197 --> 00:00:58.986
- It's like if somebody wanted
to make fries out of rice.

00:00:58.986 --> 00:01:01.666
- I kind of feel like
I'm eating dry lentils.

00:01:01.666 --> 00:01:04.307
- I would actually suggest
never to eat this ever.

00:01:04.307 --> 00:01:05.226
- These are great.

00:01:05.226 --> 00:01:08.524
- Definitely crispy, not
quite delicious though.

00:01:11.401 --> 00:01:13.507
- 'Kay, Badshahi Mix.

00:01:13.507 --> 00:01:15.043
- Little bits of crunch everywhere.

00:01:15.043 --> 00:01:17.698
- It looks like stir fry.

00:01:17.698 --> 00:01:19.602
- You've basically just
given me instant ramen.

00:01:19.602 --> 00:01:23.078
- I don't know what this
flavor is, but it's great.

00:01:23.078 --> 00:01:24.185
- It's really spicy.

00:01:24.185 --> 00:01:25.290
- This one taste like curry.

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:26.617
- It's really bad.

00:01:26.617 --> 00:01:29.587
- It's weird cause it's dry
but it has the flavor of soup.

00:01:29.587 --> 00:01:31.615
- I don't know why you just
don't make this into a chip.

00:01:31.615 --> 00:01:33.225
- You tantalize all your taste buds.

00:01:33.225 --> 00:01:34.401
- This is my favorite one so far.

00:01:34.401 --> 00:01:36.097
- I probably wouldn't buy some.

00:01:36.097 --> 00:01:38.221
- Like, I like everything (laughs).

00:01:41.415 --> 00:01:43.977
- The next taste comes all
the way from snack city.

00:01:43.977 --> 00:01:47.027
- Snack city bitch,
snack, snack city bitch.

00:01:47.027 --> 00:01:50.296
- Chillz with a z.

00:01:50.296 --> 00:01:51.920
- Little mini french fries.

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:53.148
- Yeah, they taste like sticks.

00:01:53.148 --> 00:01:54.672
- They're nice, they
taste like french fries.

00:01:54.672 --> 00:01:56.260
- They're really spicy at the end.

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:57.838
- The aftershock.

00:01:57.838 --> 00:01:59.240
- (coughs) Ow (laughs).

00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:00.845
- A sweet slow burn.

00:02:00.845 --> 00:02:03.421
- I'd say overall they're super chillz.

00:02:08.381 --> 00:02:09.815
- (singing) Shahi Deluxe it's the snack

00:02:09.815 --> 00:02:11.735
that gives you cancer.

00:02:11.735 --> 00:02:13.443
- Don't try this at home kids.

00:02:13.443 --> 00:02:14.895
- Look at what it is (laughs).

00:02:14.895 --> 00:02:16.008
- And we have McDonald's taste tests,

00:02:16.008 --> 00:02:16.935
so this is nothing.

00:02:16.935 --> 00:02:19.647
- Smells like, grandma's perfume.

00:02:19.647 --> 00:02:20.758
- (laughs)

00:02:20.758 --> 00:02:23.114
- How do you swallow this,
it's just in my mouth.

00:02:23.114 --> 00:02:24.527
- Yeah they're rocks.

00:02:24.527 --> 00:02:26.651
- Surprising this is the best
thing I've tasted all day.

00:02:26.651 --> 00:02:27.768
- Yeah, it's kind of nice.

00:02:27.768 --> 00:02:28.863
- Oh, it's so bad.

00:02:28.863 --> 00:02:30.386
- (moans)

00:02:30.386 --> 00:02:32.455
- My teeth are just
like being wedged apart.

00:02:32.455 --> 00:02:33.797
- I'm actually into this.

00:02:33.797 --> 00:02:35.447
- What are you guys doing over there?

00:02:35.447 --> 00:02:37.861
- It's like my mouth is a waiting room.

00:02:38.353 --> 00:02:40.837
- Mmm, yeah there's a very
crisp, distinct flavor to it.

00:02:40.837 --> 00:02:42.995
- Pakistan has some good snacks.

00:02:47.347 --> 00:02:48.766
- [voiceover] The finest
ingredients that guarantee

00:02:48.766 --> 00:02:53.766
both great taste and a fun time (laughs).

